<mjml><mj-head><mj-font name="Plus Jakarta Sans" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" /><mj-raw><!--[if mso]><style>body,table{font-family:Arial,sans-serif!important}</style><![endif]--></mj-raw></mj-head><mj-body background-color="#F5F6FA" width="640px"><mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="28px 32px 20px"><mj-group><mj-column width="45%"><mj-image src="{{ENTITY_LOGO_URL}}" width="170px" align="left" padding="0"/></mj-column><mj-column width="55%"><mj-table padding="0 0 0 16px"><tr><td style="border-left:1px solid #E2E8F0;padding-left:16px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600">{{ENTITY_SECRETARIAT_TITLE}}</p></td></tr></mj-table></mj-column></mj-group></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="12px 32px 24px"><mj-column><mj-text align="center" font-size="20px" font-weight="700">¡Tu pasaporte está listo!</mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 32px 24px"><mj-column><mj-image src="{{HERO_IMAGE_URL}}" width="608px" height="400px" alt="Entrega de pasaporte" border-radius="16px" padding="0"/></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 32px 24px"><mj-column><mj-text font-size="14px" line-height="20px">Felicidades, {{CITIZEN_NAME}}. Tu pasaporte ha sido expedido exitosamente y está listo para ser recogido en nuestra oficina.</mj-text><mj-text font-size="13px" color="#64748B" margin-top="12px">Por favor, diríjase a la oficina en los horarios establecidos con su documento de identidad para realizar la recogida.</mj-text></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 32px 24px"><mj-column><mj-table container-background-color="#F8F9FC" padding="24px" style="border-radius:16px;width:100%"><tr><td colspan="2" style="padding-bottom:16px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600">Horarios de entrega</p></td></tr><tr><td width="28"><span style="font-size:20px">☀️</span></td><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 12px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#64748B">Entre semana</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600">{{OFFICE_HOURS_WEEKDAY}}</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" style="height:1px;background-color:#E5E7EB;padding:0;margin:8px 0"></td></tr><tr><td width="28"><span style="font-size:20px">🌙</span></td><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 12px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#64748B">Fines de semana</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600">{{OFFICE_HOURS_WEEKEND}}</p></td></tr><tr><td colspan="2" style="height:1px;background-color:#E5E7EB;padding:0;margin:8px 0"></td></tr><tr><td width="28"><span style="font-size:20px">🏢</span></td><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 12px"><p style="margin:0;font-size:12px;color:#64748B">Ubicación</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;font-weight:600">{{OFFICE_ADDRESS}}</p></td></tr></mj-table></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="0 32px 24px"><mj-column><mj-button background-color="#1A6FE8" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="14px" font-weight="700" padding="14px 28px" border-radius="8px" href="{{RATE_URL}}" align="center">Califíquenos</mj-button></mj-column></mj-section><mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="28px 32px 32px" border-top="1px solid #F1F5F9"><mj-column><mj-text align="center" font-size="12px" color="#64748B">{{ENTITY_COPYRIGHT}}</mj-text></mj-column></mj-section></mj-body></mjml>
